.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156550/extras/d507e8ec0edbeff417842549607235d5.webm?t=1771298670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156550/extras/d507e8ec0edbeff417842549607235d5.mp4?t=1771298670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock New Plants, Recipes, Rewards, and More!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along your journey, unlock new crops to plant and harvest, recipes for tasty treats to make at the treat console, and decorations and cosmetic rewards to both beautify your garden and your robot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156550/extras/cdbb08a83d449cc75f8131afabbc7c83.poster.avif?t=1771298670\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156550/extras/cdbb08a83d449cc75f8131afabbc7c83.webm?t=1771298670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156550/extras/cdbb08a83d449cc75f8131afabbc7c83.mp4?t=1771298670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh\u2026 and there's a multiverse goat keeping you company and bringing mystery, mischief, and presents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Contemplation Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156550/header.jpg?t=1771298670","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Contemplation Games, Garden and a Goat and any associated logos, are trademarks, service marks and/or registered trademarks of the Company in the United States of America and elsewhere.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><